": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KCvY1ufaAQgQ7kNvwFIdeBf&_nc_oc=AdpbLWZiiD69egED1A28LCO4444H45Bh61T-ueEcSpa05CXehUvNcjCaS1K0XhFhbLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJFwzvW0kff9u3FZHl7_anp0M-8b71jZhIMo4O8i2ifcQ&oe=6AB26F5B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qag5dr6a2S0Q7kNvwGSla6f&_nc_oc=AdpQTyPjx--m81f097xXjIL03lIvrxnqp46oIR8kicY5w-H7VEKPflSmx4y8Go18Jj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL2iZ3RlcjalkB30OKTbthfcgwjUxZZwmAzmr8pzFJeFA&oe=6AB297E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Se1h5Q8KjJEQ7kNvwHdMGwo&_nc_oc=AdoV7ymHSSpao-ekf_1sKO809Ko8MJr6fTfTTO8jWMzSkoKxUrmZ-i9Js7zmQdM80Uk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJjCexu1qK3zXGOci4IFcOfXUa4KwyaHURbmhIcotnmZw&oe=6AB284AF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AaLLZUf0k8MQ7kNvwHxGTF2&_nc_oc=Adrg7AsbVQuFV3a5zhEH5KKviVIxr2Y0flonhOa0CiDZCBDCypM4sGfbIlCSqO6ih8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKg1TtWFvUB7VPF0TK0SxgPcjobtzD-dksIjM7FCAqiTw&oe=6AB28452"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wsJi7ZBEXs4Q7kNvwEn0Xl0&_nc_oc=AdpLpprM35LTPTVHfQcDqzSul6ndstLGQ8Jmdb62mjPB3KINXe_MOphJyUQNvv9DC0s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL9Isv4eEowvmdQXSf_8MXBozjtXeqeDN6lJwwsCoaPbA&oe=6AB28DFD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a